    final:{eyebrow:'OFF-MARKET CRE INTELLIGENCE',title:'Make every asset<br><em>ready for the right table.</em>',body:'Structure the evidence. Protect the confidentiality. Find the fit.',primary:'Request a demo <span>↗</span>',secondary:'See the plans <span>→</span>'},
    nav:{hosted:'Hosted in the EU · GDPR ready',skip:'Skip to content',how:'How it works',match:'Matching',data:'Your data',sell:'For sellers',buy:'For buyers',dark:'Dark Pool',faq:'FAQ',pricing:'Plans',login:'Log in',trial:'Request a demo',contact:'Contact: info@loptorcre.com'},
    steps:[{title:'Bring the evidence',short:'Start where the information already lives.',description:'Bring an IM, spreadsheet, broker note or message thread. The information starts where you already keep it.'},{title:'Keep the provenance',short:'Every number carries its trail.',description:'Each proposed figure keeps an explicit reference: document, page or cell. A number never appears alone.'},{title:'Surface conflicts',short:'A disagreement stays visible.',description:'When two sources disagree, LoptorCRE does not choose for you or fill the gap. The datum stays under review.'},{title:'Choose visibility',short:'You decide what the market sees.',description:'Select what the investor can see. An unconfirmed datum does not become an ambiguous gap — it simply stays out.'},{title:'Issue the teaser',short:'A4, institutional, ready to share.',description:'Generate an institutional A4 teaser with the right level of exposure: text only, one photo or gallery.'},{title:'Match anonymously',short:'Fit first. Identity later.',description:'The asset can enter a blind match with structured acquisition mandates. Identity comes only after both sides consent.'}],
    faqGroups:[['Data and traceability',[['How does a document become a teaser?','You upload documents and notes. The platform extracts each data point together with its source — document, page or cell — and the literal quote. The anonymous A4 teaser is built only from that sourced dossier.'],['Does LoptorCRE invent or complete missing data?','No. Nothing is inferred, estimated, averaged or completed. A data point without a source does not exist for the platform. What is missing is grouped in a single “Under NDA” line instead of leaving gaps.'],['What happens when two sources disagree?','The conflict is flagged and the disputed figure is not printed in the teaser. When you confirm a value, yours prevails.']]],['Anonymity and matching',[['What does an anonymous teaser reveal?','Only what you have declared and documented. Identifying details are hidden by default, EBITDA and revenue are never printed, and you decide asset by asset what else becomes visible.'],['Is the matching done by AI?','No. AI helps structure your documents; the match is calculated by transparent rules, so the same asset and the same mandate always give the same result. Hard filters come first, then a score built only from documented data.'],['When are identities revealed?','Only after both parties have reviewed the blind profile and explicitly consented to contact. Then a Deal Room opens to continue the conversation.'],['Can I share a teaser with someone outside the platform?','Yes, with a private link. It cannot be guessed, it expires after 60 days and you can revoke it at any time. The recipient asks for access with an email and sees a sanitised version of the teaser, and every access is traceable.']]],['Privacy and data',[['Is my information used to train AI?','No. Nothing you upload or write is used to train AI models. Your dossier is private: only you can access it before you share it, and Loptor does not access it either.'],['Where is my information processed?','In the European Union: the AI provider and our analytics both run on EU infrastructure.']]],['Access and plans',[['Who is LoptorCRE for?','Anyone who trades commercial real estate off-market, on either side of the deal: brokers, boutiques, family offices, funds, real estate companies such as SOCIMIs and REITs, and industry professionals and analysts. There is no country restriction: whether you operate from Madrid, Milan, London or Amsterdam, assets and mandates are described by their documents and matched the same way. At launch, commercial real estate only.'],['Which languages and currencies does it support?','The platform works in English and Spanish; the French experience is in development. Tickets can be expressed in EUR, CHF, USD and GBP.'],['How do the plans work?','There are four plans — Advisor, Desk, Institutional and Enterprise — with different limits on assets and mandates. There are no public prices: request a demo and we will recommend the right level.']]]]
